{"id": "boolq/test/2634", "source": "boolq", "primitive": "noul", "split": "test", "state": "{\"passage\": \"In seasons 13 and 14, April faces a crisis of faith as she begins to believe that good people get punished and bad people get good things. She does this after treating 3 seemingly simple patients who are good people and die. Including Matthew's (her ex finacee) new pregnant wife, after delivery. Robbins then tells April it's her fault. As a result, she goes into a dark place and uses partying and sex to mask her deep-rooted pain. She earns the nickname ``The Party'' by the new interns. She refuses to let Jackson help her through this time. However, mid-Season 14, she encounters a terminal patient who helps April reaffirm her faith. April starts seeing Matthew again and their relationship is made public when the two are involved in a car accident, where April almost dies of hypothermia. In the season finale, April and Matthew get married.\", \"question\": \"do jackson and april get back together after divorce\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Based only on `passage`, is the answer to `question` yes?\"}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"google/boolq\", \"license\": \"cc-by-sa-3.0\", \"domain\": \"reading-comprehension\", \"task_family\": \"grounded-yes-no\", \"hf_config\": \"default\"}"}
